    "en": {
      "name": "Marincess Blue Crystal Heart",
      "effect": "2 \"Marincess\" monsters\n(This card is always treated as \"Marincess Crystal Heart\".)\nYou can target 1 \"Marincess\" Link Monster in your GY; Special Summon it to your zone this card points to. If this card is sent to the GY as material for a Link-3 or higher \"Marincess\" Link Monster: You can send 1 \"Marincess\" card from your Deck to the GY. You can only use each effect of \"Marincess Blue Crystal Heart\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
